{"attack":"借助场地的力量进行攻击。视使出招式时场地状态不同，招式的属性和威力会有所变化。","description":"借助场地的力量进行攻击。视使出招式时场地状态不同，招式的属性和威力会有所变化，以下为各场地的招式属性和威力：\n\n无场地——一般——50\n电气场地——电——100\n精神场地——超能力——100\n薄雾场地——妖精——100\n青草场地——草——100\n\n在宝可梦极巨化时，大地波动在选择招式的界面会变为极巨攻击，但是实际使出时会根据当时的场地变化为对应属性的极巨招式或超极巨招式。\n非地面上的宝可梦使用大地波动时，不会随场地发生变化。\n大地波动受特性超级发射器影响。","levelUpMoves":[{"Name":"Smoliv","Level":38},{"Name":"Dolliv","Level":42},{"Name":"Arboliva","Level":46}],"tutorMoves":["Venusaur","Blastoise","Exeggutor","Exeggutor form:alolan","Lickitung","Kangaskhan","Snorlax","Mew","Dunsparce","Exploud","Lucario","Lickilicky","Regigigas","Stunfisk form:galarian","Clauncher","Clawitzer","Carbink","Xerneas form:neutral","Xerneas form:active","Diancie","Oranguru","Palossand","TypeNull","Silvally","Silvally form:grass","Silvally form:fire","Silvally form:water","Silvally form:flying","Silvally form:bug","Silvally form:poison","Silvally form:electric","Silvally form:psychic","Silvally form:rock","Silvally form:ground","Silvally form:dark","Silvally form:ghost","Silvally form:steel","Silvally form:fighting","Silvally form:ice","Silvally form:dragon","Silvally form:fairy","Indeedee form:male","Indeedee form:female"],"eggMoves":[],"trMoves":[],"hmMoves":[],"transferMoves":[],"tmMoves9":[],"tmMoves8":[],"tmMoves7":[],"tmMoves6":[],"tmMoves5":[],"tmMoves4":[],"tmMoves3":[],"tmMoves2":[],"tmMoves1":[],"tmMoves":[]}